Two design choices to check:
- **Delete rotates the stored ETag** to a random value. This makes a PUT racing a DELETE fail cleanly (410 or 412) instead of resurrecting a tombstone. Deleted items are never served, so their ETag is never visible.
- **Subject and category must be non-blank.** The spec doesn't define the validation rules, so I chose this minimum.

