Notes on the design:

- Entities are `Depot` (warehouse) and `Consignment` (shipment); `Consignment.DownloadCount` is initialized to 0 and incremented on each GET of a shipment; `Depot.LastAuditAt` is server-maintained (left null here, since no audit operation was specified — it's never exposed in DTOs so clients can't set it).
- `POST /api/warehouses/{warehouseId}/shipments` returns 404 if the warehouse doesn't exist; cascades delete consignments when a depot is deleted.
